<title>NEW ZEALAND: Donaghy's yr net profit falls sharply.</title>
<headline>Donaghy's yr net profit falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 5.53 vs 29.63</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 15.5 vs 69.5</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  8.0 vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		15.0 vs 13.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				   124.6 vs 206.7</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				7.6 vs 35.8</p>
<p>    Tax					    2.1 vs 5.1</p>
<p>    Equity earnings			    0.1 vs nil</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  30.5 vs 42.1</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 31</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 25</p>
<p>    Ex div   Oct 28</p>
<p>Note - Donaghys Ltd is a rope and webbing manufacturing.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
